  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The ratio K<sub>p</sub> to K<sub>c</sub> of a reaction is 24.63 L atm mol<sup>–1</sup> at 27°C. If heat of reaction at constant pressure is 98.8 kcal, what is the heat of reaction (in kcal)&nbsp; at constant volume?</p>\r"
  },
  "options": [],
